{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "8e93f7a6c2108e85dd7257e69a24c32d771d53db6f4347fa6adff9169546ae41", "ja": "姉妹　a.k.a.　ライバル", "zh": "姐妹 a.k.a. 竞争对手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "67d852c00c5dffe826b3e634fcf0c3afd64daded2793effe9f350bb1181fe671", "ja": "ある日真美はプロデューサーに相談を持ちか\nける。亜美の方がラップがうまい、テイスト\nを変えたいと言う真美に、プロデューサーは\nラップ勝負を挑む。戦いの中でスタイルを掴\nんだ真美は、亜美と決闘すると言い出した。", "zh": "某天，真美找制作人商量事情。\n真美说亚美的说唱更厉害，自己想\n改变风格，于是制作人向她发起\n说唱对决。在对决中抓住了自己风格\n的真美，提出要和亚美一决胜负。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8d6d59523c0dba718345ce464d1cefe3cd27ed3582a3d985f10a62465ce4cbd5", "ja": "（公園での衝撃的な出会いの後。3人は、\n精力的にラップのレッスンを始めた。そして……）", "zh": "（在公园那场冲击性的相遇之后，3人开始积极地进行说唱训练。然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ee454d2bae29523ebdd16f75a6dd9e86423b8b8f863e577b7c700629ed361da9", "ja": "よし！　今日はここまでにしよう。\nみんな、最初と比べると、すごく上手になったな。", "zh": "好！今天就先练到这里吧。\n大家跟最初比起来，进步可真大啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "f7bd0c64300e390982566468e8d4aac881f5a1c3c2959a094edbdd9da6f2dd65", "ja": "私も、ちょっと手応えを感じてます。\nあの公園のラッパーさん達のおかげかもしれませんね！", "zh": "我也稍微感受到了一些成果。或许是多亏了公园里的那些说唱歌手吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "ac33de3bbadcf5d0396d8516885f08eb01529a8ed46e0af0a90919ab22cb9a25", "ja": "うんうん。今日の律っちゃん、めっちゃ楽しそうに\nやってたね！　亜美もサイファーしてて面白かった！", "zh": "嗯嗯。今天的律子姐，玩得特别开心呢！亚美也参加了即兴说唱，觉得好有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "b82bbea5bfdb623d9188112b37f7330cea9c969e4c0c32ae75192a05f3984dd0", "ja": "真美も！　んっふっふ～♪　律っちゃんが\n素晴らしいライバルに育って、真美は鼻が高いよ……。", "zh": "真美也是！嗯哼哼～♪律子也成长为了出色的对手，真美真是倍感自豪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "b4faec45616161a1d96cd232eb1dd61e395b5678379c603296c96f34cee071cb", "ja": "ふたりが言うなら、レベルアップで間違いないわね。\n本番は、もっと熱い戦いにしましょうね！", "zh": "既然你们两个人都这么说，那肯定是升级了。  \n正式演出时，我们来一场更加热烈的较量吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "82da7b70b93fda85222862b058f0a4e68255b318cd9c7abe76121cc5fcfc3596", "ja": "じゃあ、明日もこの調子で\n頑張って仕上げていこうな！　解散！", "zh": "那么，明天也保持这个状态，继续努力完成吧！解散！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "c80aff4297703e9bc4d8d05722132000f475c1d27df0791fab78167688509127", "ja": "おつかれさまでしたー！", "zh": "辛苦大家了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "c80aff4297703e9bc4d8d05722132000f475c1d27df0791fab78167688509127", "ja": "おつかれさまでしたー！", "zh": "辛苦大家了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "c80aff4297703e9bc4d8d05722132000f475c1d27df0791fab78167688509127", "ja": "おつかれさまでしたー！", "zh": "辛苦大家了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f7351494fd622f0749351fbe9074cddb41412e78277218915e05e04ae9f0e647", "ja": "よし、今日の事務処理はこれで終わり。\nラップの音源を聴いていたら、意外と捗ったな……。", "zh": "好，今天的文书工作就到这里。\n一边听着说唱音源，不知不觉效率还挺高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1012_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "9b650e12208688ccbe841afdde1f9e0f7581e7bde15b7b07f79085bd584001fc", "ja": "ねーねー、兄ちゃん。\n真美、ちょっと相談があるんだけど。", "zh": "呐呐，哥哥。\n真美有点事想和你商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "18003f16a8f27e771b66e1b0ba6210eb1ffcc1f2d6b1bf48f8f4e02dc2464e4a", "ja": "あれっ？　真美、まだ残ってたのか？", "zh": "咦？真美，你还没走啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "3589b34752213587718706cdd1b914b8d98d2a169e1a219e9da7094cffff3d63", "ja": "あ、うん。ひとりで買い物行くフリして、\nコッソリ劇場に戻って、屋上でソロ練してた。", "zh": "啊，嗯。我假装要一个人去买东西，悄悄回到剧场，在楼顶练习独唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bc1e01a9e653107a5db312dd61e0c816d133534197a7ffc28fa07b721b0ac658", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nそれで、相談っていうのは……？", "zh": "原来是这样。\n那么，你说的商量是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "df820e5c2ec5ec909811ad268fe1ad27e58041575e7acc090ce9bdb1aa678aee", "ja": "うん。あのさ、兄ちゃん。\n真美のラップスタイルってさー……。", "zh": "嗯。我说啊，哥。\n真美的说唱风格啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "1f941a7207a8ee76db41a5406c7d351e4b242c9f3545a00e2e55c3b806d59ba8", "ja": "正直……。亜美と……かぶってない？", "zh": "说实话……是不是和亚美……撞风格了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8e5e7cab30f4b3bcc69c3c3346c1c66e778a9e12bc6da507f011eafdd7b703aa", "ja": "え……。ま、まあ、そうかもしれないけど。\nでもいいじゃないか、双子なんだし。", "zh": "呃……这、这个嘛，也许确实是这样。\n不过没关系吧，毕竟你们是双胞胎嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "508c1569c33ec6ae40793f33831e81de3f6998ae203c3e621553a729175100ad", "ja": "だよね。でも……なんか、よくない気がして。\nなんて言ったらいいかわかんないけど、ダメなんだ。", "zh": "对吧。不过……总觉得，好像不太好。\n虽然不知道该怎么说，但就是不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "1b3b8f2b99fae87564693d01b32c2ea73d68699721121be4e48e77a00c6d7fbd", "ja": "今日のサイファーが楽しすぎて、気がついちゃった。\n真美の敵は律っちゃんじゃなくて……亜美なのかも。", "zh": "今天的即兴说唱实在太开心了，我才意识到这一点。\n真美的敌人不是律子，而是……也许是亚美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "807cf4fe2683ff76e242adac1b26645560723d8b46705c0400a8ed193723477c", "ja": "そうなのか……けど、どうしてそう思うんだ？", "zh": "是这样吗……不过，你为什么会这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "09c6d497b27dd57cf50d98ec2f163fae090e40e38d82c92b454bf988eaa9a181", "ja": "だって……同じラップスタイルなのに\n亜美のほうがちょっとだけ、言葉、うまくない？", "zh": "因为……明明是同样的说唱风格，可亚美的用词，是不是稍微更好一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "14897c8b0c51d450061a4a4baa0df6cf1d0455222fb63e3e88cb84b9e7103118", "ja": "（言われてみれば……確かに亜美と真美の言葉は\nほんの少し、違うのかもしれない。でも……）", "zh": "（这么一说……确实，亚美和真美说话的方式\n或许真的有一点点不同。但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "9e636a4d3b95d9009bf2b3f84e22b1a46e35e597fba13b4f3b42a561948cd5cf", "ja": "真美は、亜美にだけは絶対、負けたくないんだ……。", "zh": "真美绝对不想输给亚美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "c4de9f6d2ecee150e50a6c58ab76502841b57d3c1a484f0341543fcd7206b5b0", "ja": "どうすればいいかな？　兄ちゃん。\n真美、ちょっぴり味変したほうがいい？", "zh": "该怎么办才好呢？哥哥。\n真美是不是该稍微换换风格？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "70199b98466a71a049905fd300a52fe08855cfbf6d90dcdc5cd37a2e0fc9bf29", "ja": "味変……テイストを変えるか。いや、楽しければ\nそのままでいい気がするけど、真美がそう言うなら。", "zh": "换换口味……是要改变风格吗。不，我觉得只要开心\n保持原样也挺好的，不过既然真美都这么说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "ebb4d4e912eb1b0b3f4db66c66cd395a7132cb8a805e0650776d339954b48dd2", "ja": "わかった！　真美はこれから\n真美の味を探す旅に出るよ！", "zh": "明白了！真美这就出发，\n踏上寻找真美风格的旅途！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "904a124beab6376da111fd0fc3c2db5e792110d04c7803b500bbc6d2626beab0", "ja": "ま、待った！　もう夜も遅いし、うーん……\nそうだ！！", "zh": "等、等等！天色已经很晚了，唔……\n有了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "e376a48c656e640e3768d025994bd830c7a71aa1d37387e520a0be17b0742db4", "ja": "俺が色々なテーマを出すから、真美はそれに沿って\nラップをするんだ。つまり、訓練だ！", "zh": "我会出各种主题，真美你就根据主题来即兴说唱。也就是说，这是训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "c6fc6fd31e73cca641f85120e5e88a3c36bb17675dbcd58fc4292228c14d96b2", "ja": "兄ちゃん……真美のために、そこまで……。\nわかったよ。その勝負受けて立つよ、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "哥哥……竟然为了真美做到这种地步……  \n知道了。这场比试，真美接下了，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "acdcafcbc1d2408f12c812165ca86c16622ffd0c4f4aa3ddadbc6309fd458693", "ja": "よし、行くぞ！　特訓その1……「イカつく！」", "zh": "好，要上啦！特训其之1……“凶狠一点！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "2aef41f45cfe2c435b51760bf20294b17601a5acd076727255895e07588f5255", "ja": "おうコラ兄ちゃん　真美なめるな　ONE SHOT,\nONE KILL　油断してっと飛ばすぜその首AH？", "zh": "喂，小子，别小看真美！ONE SHOT，ONE KILL——敢掉以轻心，就把你那颗脑袋轰飞，啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "b081fc3e82e4eb61aff0fba021fa474c6ff3c4d06170e463a70809dddeaf02fc", "ja": "特訓その2……「気怠いフィメールラッパー！」", "zh": "特训第2……“慵懒的女说唱歌手！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
